	[[This patch includes two patch files for Dinkum, a HexBin file which
	 generates a MacIntosh makefile for Dinkum, a new Unix Makefile for
	 Dinkum, and a new README. Most of the changes in the patch are to
	 provide portability for Dinkum to the Coherent operating system,
	 the MacIntosh and some flavors of Gcc. Only very trivial corrections
	 were made to Dinkum itself (mainly typographical errors).

                                   Gary]]


